div.p:
Kissinger: Look, if we buy 18 months,
                    let’s buy it for nothing. If we get tied to three years with American stations,
                    no American plan, then we are stuck.

note.p:
Source: Library of Congress, Manuscript Division, Kissinger Papers, CL 273, Chronological File, June 1975. Secret;
                        Nodis. The meeting was held in the
                    Secretary’s office at the White House.
